      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know how to describe it anymore. everything just feels... heavy. like i'm walking through deep water all day. i'm just so incredibly tired of trying to keep up with everything. even sleeping doesnt help. i feel like i've been running on empty for years and there's just nothing left in the tank.",
